  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tan Thuan Nearshore Wind Project, through DNV KEMA Renewables, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant partially funds a feasibility study for the Tan Thuan Intertidal Wind Power Plant for Power Engineering Consulting Joint Stock Company 2. The study will assess the technical, economic and financial viability of developing a 100-megawatt wind farm in southern Vietnam. The project would capitalize on southern Vietnam&apos;s strong wind resource, and help expand and diversify Vietnam&apos;s power generation mix to meet rapidly growing electricity demands. This memorandum serves to revise the project title for the Vietnam Tan Thuan Nearshore Wind Project FS (Activity No. 2017-31019A).</narrative>
  </description>
